        "name": "3c3a9740-17c4-4ab8-80e3-4d9ff9ebe6ed",
        "notes": "Data on five electronic health information (EHI) indicators for health care providers, including three Shared Health Priorities (SHP) indicators. Two additional EHI indicators are included to provide context on digital health literacy. Results are available for Canada and each province, disaggregated by age, gender, region, care setting, and occupation.\n<br>",
        "notes_translated": {
          "en": "Data on five electronic health information (EHI) indicators for health care providers, including three Shared Health Priorities (SHP) indicators. Two additional EHI indicators are included to provide context on digital health literacy. Results are available for Canada and each province, disaggregated by age, gender, region, care setting, and occupation.\n<br>",
          "fr": "Cinq indicateurs liés à l'information électronique sur la santé (IES) pour les fournisseurs de soins de santé, dont trois indicateurs des Priorités partagées en santé (PPS). Deux autres indicateurs d'IES sont inclus afin de fournir un contexte supplémentaire sur la littératie numérique en santé. Les résultats sont offerts pour le Canada et chaque province, selon l'âge, le genre, la région, le milieu de soins et la profession.\n<br>"
        },
